  "body": "Adds the MCP tools `set_tool_holder` and `list_holder_library`, so an agent can pick a holder for a tool the same way the GUI does.\n\n- `set_tool_holder` goes through `SetToolBody`, so it is one undo step.\n- `get_job` now shows each tool's holder.\n- New module `crates/app/src/mcp/holders.rs`. The camcraft-mcp skill documents both tools.\n- Decision record: `docs/decisions/799-mcp-set-tool-holder.md`.\n\nEffort: medium. The fork is synced at v0.17.0. This PR bumps `.claude/PROCESS_VERSION` because it changes the camcraft-mcp skill.\n\n**How tested:** pinned by `crates/app/tests/mcp_holder.rs`. The quick gate is green on 7d2b536d (app suites; upstream main merged in, PROCESS_VERSION now 16).\n**Not exercised:** the GUI. The change is MCP-only.\n\nChangelog: MCP: `set_tool_holder` and `list_holder_library` tools; `get_job` lists each tool's holder (#799)\n\nFixes #799\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAgjpiZbXSvmXLvdmL\n",
